1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
Faedah kedua.

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:04,380
Lagi kata, man

3
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:07,762
marida aw safara.

4
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:11,204
Siapa sakit, atau dia musafir,

5
00:00:11,204 --> 00:00:14,030
kutiba lahu ma kana ya'maluhu

6
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:15,590
sahihan muqiman.

7
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:17,800
Dicatat bagi dia apa yang dia

8
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,900
biasa buat ketika mana dia sihat

9
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:23,160
dan ketika mana dia bermukim.

10
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:26,870
Masa dia sihat, dia sembahyang sunat

11
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:29,080
dhuha tak tinggal.

12
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:32,300
Masa dia tak musafir, dia amalkan

13
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,150
solat sunat dhuha dia.

14
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:36,950
Bila dia sakit, tak boleh buat

15
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:38,730
macam biasa dia buat.

16
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:41,220
Selama ni buat lapan, tak larat

17
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,630
lapan, dah buat dua lagi.

18
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:45,690
Dia dah tinggal pula rupanya sebab sakit.

19
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:47,110
Atau kerana musafir, urusan

20
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:50,210
pelbagai, dah tinggal hal sunat.

21
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:52,980
Nabi kata siapa yang sakit dan

22
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:55,830
orang yang musafir, dia tak boleh

23
00:00:55,830 --> 00:00:57,680
buat hal biasa dia buat, Allah

24
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:59,910
catat untuk dia apa hal dia

25
00:00:59,910 --> 00:01:01,940
biasa buat tu.

26
00:01:01,940 --> 00:01:04,300
Maksudnya biasa amalannya dia pagi

27
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:06,580
pukul lapan terus solat sunat dhuha.

28
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:08,280
Dia tak boleh buat hari ni,

29
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,930
atau dia terlupa hari ni, atau

30
00:01:09,930 --> 00:01:12,700
dia sakit hari ni, dia dapat pahala

31
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:16,150
yang sama macam dia buat.

32
00:01:16,350 --> 00:01:18,180
Berdasarkan hadis itu kita ambil,

33
00:01:18,180 --> 00:01:20,340
kita kaitkan hadis sini, maknanya

34
00:01:20,340 --> 00:01:23,010
hal Nabi kata separuh-separuh ni

35
00:01:23,010 --> 00:01:25,040
merujuk kepada hal sunat.

36
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:27,410
Kalau hal fardu, dia nak berdiri

37
00:01:27,410 --> 00:01:30,130
tapi tak boleh berdiri, sakit, dia

38
00:01:30,130 --> 00:01:30,940
pun duduk.

39
00:01:30,940 --> 00:01:33,360
Kalau dia sihat, dia berdiri.

40
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:36,450
Maksudnya pahala, pahala yang sama.

41
00:01:36,450 --> 00:01:38,300
Itu satu sudut
